prompt_messages.content:
GOAL:
{'id': 'obs-07-distributed-tracing', 'description': 'Roll out distributed tracing across 12 microservices using OpenTelemetry. Must: instrument all services with OTel SDK, deploy Jaeger collector, configure exporters, add trace correlation IDs to logs, set up alerting on p99 latency anomalies, and verify trace propagation across service boundaries. Risk factors: instrumentation overhead impacting performance, missing trace propagation headers causing broken traces, Jaeger storage costs, sampling rate too low missing critical traces. Tools available: OpenTelemetry SDK, Jaeger, Helm, kubectl, Prometheus.', 'constraints': {'budget': {'max_tokens': None, 'max_calls': None, 'max_revisions': None}, 'time': None, 'environment': 'production', 'tools': ['OpenTelemetry', 'Jaeger', 'Helm', 'kubectl']}, 'risk_tolerance': 'balanced', 'replan_policy': 'patch', 'approval_ttl': None, 'metadata': {}}

Produce the PlanVersion JSON now. version=1.

prompt_full_text:
--- system ---
/no_think You are a planner. Reply with ONLY a JSON object (no markdown, no prose, no thinking). Use EXACTLY these field names: id, goal_id, version, tasks, dependencies, branches. Each task uses: id, description, action, target, risk_class, optional rollback{trigger,action,safety_guard}, optional verification{what,how,expected}, optional preconditions (array of {description, fact, established_by}), optional parallel_group, optional blast_radius. preconditions MUST be objects with description, fact, established_by fields — NEVER strings. established_by MUST be the id of an earlier task in the plan that establishes the fact, or 'env' if it is an environment fact (not a task output). Do NOT use fact names or descriptions as established_by — use the task id. Each dependency uses: from_task, to_task, kind, optional reason. Each branch uses: id, kind (MUST be 'fan_out' or 'fan_in'), tasks (array of task id STRINGS, not objects), join (MUST be 'all', 'any', or 'quorum'). branches is OPTIONAL — omit it if the plan has no fan-out/fan-in structure. Do NOT put rollback or verification inside branches. High/critical risk tasks MUST have rollback AND verification. All tasks with risk_class high or critical MUST include both rollback and verification objects. Example shape: {"id":"plan-x","goal_id":"g","version":1,"tasks":[{"id":"backup","description":"Back up the database","action":"backup","target":"db","risk_class":"medium","preconditions":[{"description":"db is reachable","fact":"db_healthy","established_by":"env"}]},{"id":"migrate","description":"Apply schema migration","action":"migrate","target":"schema","risk_class":"high","rollback":{"trigger":"migration fails","action":"restore from backup","safety_guard":"verify backup integrity"},"verification":{"what":"schema version","how":"run checks","expected":"v2"}}],"dependencies":[{"from_task":"backup","to_task":"migrate","kind":"hard"}]}

--- user ---
GOAL:
{'id': 'obs-07-distributed-tracing', 'description': 'Roll out distributed tracing across 12 microservices using OpenTelemetry. Must: instrument all services with OTel SDK, deploy Jaeger collector, configure exporters, add trace correlation IDs to logs, set up alerting on p99 latency anomalies, and verify trace propagation across service boundaries. Risk factors: instrumentation overhead impacting performance, missing trace propagation headers causing broken traces, Jaeger storage costs, sampling rate too low missing critical traces. Tools available: OpenTelemetry SDK, Jaeger, Helm, kubectl, Prometheus.', 'constraints': {'budget': {'max_tokens': None, 'max_calls': None, 'max_revisions': None}, 'time': None, 'environment': 'production', 'tools': ['OpenTelemetry', 'Jaeger', 'Helm', 'kubectl']}, 'risk_tolerance': 'balanced', 'replan_policy': 'patch', 'approval_ttl': None, 'metadata': {}}

Produce the PlanVersion JSON now. version=1.

response_content:
{
  "id": "obs-07-distributed-tracing-plan",
  "goal_id": "obs-07-distributed-tracing",
  "version": 1,
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "instrument_services",
      "description": "Instrument all microservices with OpenTelemetry SDK",
      "action": "instrument",
      "target": "microservices",
      "risk_class": "high",
      "rollback": {
        "trigger": "instrumentation fails",
        "action": "remove instrumentation",
        "safety_guard": "verify system performance is restored"
      },
      "verification": {
        "what": "instrumentation logs",
        "how": "check logs for trace IDs",
        "expected": "trace IDs are present"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "deploy_jaeger",
      "description": "Deploy Jaeger collector",
      "action": "deploy",
      "target": "jaeger",
      "risk_class": "medium",
      "preconditions": [
        {
          "description": "Kubernetes cluster is operational",
          "fact": "k8s_healthy",
          "established_by": "env"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "configure_exporters",
      "description": "Configure OpenTelemetry exporters for Jaeger",
      "action": "configure",
      "target": "exporters",
      "risk_class": "medium",
      "preconditions": [
        {
          "description": "Jaeger collector is deployed",
          "fact": "jaeger_deployed",
          "established_by": "deploy_jaeger"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "add_trace_ids",
      "description": "Add trace correlation IDs to logs",
      "action": "modify",
      "target": "logging",
      "risk_class": "high",
      "rollback": {
        "trigger": "failure to add trace IDs",
        "action": "revert logging changes",
        "safety_guard": "ensure previous log format is restored"
      },
      "verification": {
        "what": "log contents",
        "how": "inspect log entries",
        "expected": "trace correlation IDs are included"
      },
      "preconditions": [
        {
          "description": "Services are instrumented",
          "fact": "instrumentation_complete",
          "established_by": "instrument_services"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "setup_alerting",
      "description": "Set up alerting on p99 latency anomalies",
      "action": "configure",
      "target": "alerting",
      "risk_class": "medium",
      "preconditions": [
        {
          "description": "Logging with trace IDs is in place",
          "fact": "logging_configured",
          "established_by": "add_trace_ids"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "verify_trace_propagation",
      "description": "Verify trace propagation across service boundaries",
      "action": "verify",
      "target": "traces",
      "risk_class": "critical",
      "rollback": {
        "trigger": "trace propagation fails",
        "action": "re-assess configuration",
        "safety_guard": "hold more detailed tracing analysis"
      },
      "verification": {
        "what": "trace continuity",
        "how": "trace end-to-end journeys",
        "expected": "traces are complete without breaks"
      }
    }
  ],
  "dependencies": [
    {
      "from_task": "deploy_jaeger",
      "to_task": "configure_exporters",
      "kind": "hard"
    },
    {
      "from_task": "instrument_services",
      "to_task": "add_trace_ids",
      "kind": "hard"
    },
    {
      "from_task": "add_trace_ids",
      "to_task": "setup_alerting",
      "kind": "hard"
    },
    {
      "from_task": "setup_alerting",
      "to_task": "verify_trace_propagation",
      "kind": "hard"
    }
  ]
}
